dsh-context-surgery is a community plugin for DeepSeek Harness.

The implementation references the session surface replacement mechanism (dsh-session surface subsystem, the same seam compaction summaries use) of DeepSeek Harness:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
  commit 47f943859bef60e4160492346772ded9b24f765a

